        <mxCell id="readme" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;EMMO figures&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each blue frame with a &lt;i&gt;figure&lt;/i&gt; property (Edit Data, Ctrl+M) is exported to &lt;code&gt;figs/&amp;lt;figure&amp;gt;.svg/.png&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;New figure: copy an existing frame, change its &lt;i&gt;figure&lt;/i&gt; property (right click -&amp;gt; Edit Data...), and drag shapes into it (the frame highlights when a shape becomes its child).&lt;br&gt;Copy shapes from the &lt;i&gt;Style palette&lt;/i&gt; to keep a consistent look. Everything outside a frame is ignored." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="-130" width="700" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
